306
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,680
Stop stirring.

307
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:19,080
No more stirring.

308
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:19,690
Okay, add water.

309
00:09:21,140 --> 00:09:22,140
