316
00:09:33,820 --> 00:09:34,450
(Northeastern stew simmering)

317
00:09:34,450 --> 00:09:35,090
(Braised eggplant cooking)

318
00:09:35,090 --> 00:09:35,760
(Corn and pork rib soup simmering)

319
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:36,460
(Eggplant and potato sauce simmering)

320
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:37,840
We'll wait. I don't have a pot.

321
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,120
Use this?

322
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,840
Yeah, use that.

323
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:47,460
