Scallions and dried chilies.

358
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:09,600
Dried chilies.

359
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,160
Green beans.

360
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:10,560
Right.

361
00:11:11,140 --> 00:11:12,440
(AI smart recipe)
One spoon of soy sauce,

362
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,820
(AI smart recipe)
half a spoon of oyster sauce.

363
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:14,700
Noodles go in too.

364
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:15,940
Okay.

365
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:19,790
Done.

366
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,530
I have a feeling this'll be really good.

367
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,800
Bing, is this about done?

368
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:25,320
My eggplant.

369
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:26,680
Just add some sauce

370
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,640
