371
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,370
Sauce coming in.

372
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:32,410
Garnish.

373
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:34,900
(This is garnish?)

374
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,480
