375
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,340
I love cilantro.

376
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:39,620
(My favorite)

377
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:41,560
You can never have too much cilantro.

378
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:43,720
There's more cilantro than eggplant.

379
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:45,150
How much do you love cilantro?

380
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:47,030
One final garnish.

381
00:11:47,030 --> 00:11:49,780
