404
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,420
No, salt.

405
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:42,450
Salt?

406
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,840
That's it.

407
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,700
It's salt?

408
