560
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,400
Churan,

561
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:21,760
you're gonna do great this season.

562
00:18:21,760 --> 00:18:23,440
I really think it's pretty good.

563
00:18:28,380 --> 00:18:30,020
