00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:47,920
What's this?

571
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,800
Looks like it melted down.

572
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,440
Yeah, that's the whole point.

573
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,000
What's this?

574
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:53,000
The eggplant and potatoes from earlier.

575
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:55,150
Mix this with rice, I'm telling you.

576
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:57,870
This is cooked down perfectly.

577
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,360
Just pour it over rice.

578
00:19:09,760 --> 00:19:11,080
You're adding eggs?

579
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:11,650
Makes it thicker.

580
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:12,180
(5. Add water until level
with the vegetables)

581
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:12,850
(6. Add seasoning and simmer)

582
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:13,460
(7. Add eggs to thicken)

583
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:22,220
(8. Top with minced garlic,
diced green pepper, and cilantro)

584
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,440
That's a huge pot!

585
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,840
It still won't be enough.

586
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:26,220
Perfect.

587
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,350
Let's go eat.

588
00:19:28,660 --> 00:19:30,460
(Jia Bing's eggplant and potato sauce)

589
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:32,700
(Jia Bing's grilled beef
with water celery)

590
00:19:32,740 --> 00:19:34,660
(Fan Chengcheng and Wang Anyu's
green bean noodles)

591
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:36,940
(Bai Jingting and Hu Xianxu's
braised eggplant, remake)

592
00:19:36,980 --> 00:19:38,580
(Huang Jingyu's Northeastern stew)

593
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:41,060
Not eating Bing's food while it's hot

594
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,420
