595
00:19:44,900 --> 00:19:45,900
(Then hurry and eat it hot)

596
00:19:45,900 --> 00:19:46,390
This...

597
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,130
So good.

598
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:52,460
(Good Bai: eggplant
and potato sauce over rice)

599
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:54,100
(Already started tasting)

600
00:19:56,180 --> 00:19:57,660
(Cooling off)

601
00:19:57,800 --> 00:19:59,060
Leather pants are kinda hot.

602
00:19:59,060 --> 00:19:59,980
(Saw that coming)

603
00:20:00,020 --> 00:20:00,920
(Paying the price
for dressing out of season)

604
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,030
Quick, blow some air on me.

605
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:04,080
Coming up.

606
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:06,320
A mountain of glass noodles!

607
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:07,440
Put it here. No one likes them anyway.

608
00:20:07,500 --> 00:20:09,020
(I'm not greedy. The food belongs here)

609
00:20:10,120 --> 00:20:10,870
Bing's.

610
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:12,890
This is Bing's.

611
00:20:15,780 --> 00:20:16,460
(Starting with some glass noodles)

612
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,120
Mixed it with rice?

613
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:18,870
Of course.

614
00:20:19,560 --> 00:20:20,500
So good.

615
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,290
This eggplant sauce is insanely good!

616
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:25,160
The one we made?

617
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:26,860
(Of course it's Bing's)

618
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:30,400
Bing, this isn't really a sauce.

619
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:31,920
What should we call it?

620
00:20:32,360 --> 00:20:33,530
Eggplant-potato mash.

621
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:34,430
Yeah.

622
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:35,990
So good.

623
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:38,620
(Two huge scoops)

624
00:20:42,180 --> 00:20:44,100
(Devouring it)

625
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:44,910
This is wild.

626
00:20:44,910 --> 00:20:46,540
(That familiar taste)

627
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:56,180
(Taste buds completely won over)
It really is amazing.

628
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:58,160
First day back and we already get this.

629
00:20:58,160 --> 00:20:59,960
