This is what I wanted most, Bing.

630
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:00,480
The sauce.

631
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,920
I gotta learn how to make this.

632
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:04,600
Me too.

633
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:06,350
Three potatoes.

634
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:07,760
(Learning on the spot)
Four eggplants.

635
00:21:07,760 --> 00:21:09,320
For two eggplants, one potato's enough.

636
00:21:09,320 --> 00:21:11,240
For three eggplants, use two potatoes.

637
00:21:11,320 --> 00:21:12,800
Then tell me the seasonings, Bing.

638
00:21:12,800 --> 00:21:13,160
Sure.

639
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:14,440
It's super easy.

640
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:15,840
Just stew it long enough.

641
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:16,760
Let me try it.

642
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:17,410
I'll get a bowl.

643
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:20,520
I'll mix some for you.

644
00:21:20,700 --> 00:21:22,860
(Getting bro a scoop to try)

645
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:24,580
Thanks.

646
00:21:29,860 --> 00:21:31,660
(That familiar flavor)

647
00:21:32,360 --> 00:21:33,760
So? Want a bowl?

648
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:39,350
Get me some of my stew.

649
00:21:39,850 --> 00:21:40,480
Give me a scoop.

650
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:43,780
Don't! They're still eating it!

651
00:21:44,130 --> 00:21:44,920
No one's eating it.

652
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:45,840
Right now,

653
00:21:45,920 --> 00:21:48,010
I'm the only one who's
picked out two tomatoes.

654
00:21:51,480 --> 00:21:52,480
Look, everyone's still eating.

655
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:53,200
That's not nice.

656
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:53,680
Just take it.

657
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:54,520
We can't do that.

658
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:55,910
Hurry. I'll put it back later.

659
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:59,660
I'll get some eggplant.

660
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:01,100
Okay.

661
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:03,280
Are you giving my rice back?

662
00:22:03,360 --> 00:22:03,920
This is your rice?

663
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:04,840
I thought...

664
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:05,480
It's your rice?

665
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,880
I just meant for you to try a bite.

666
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:07,720
I thought it was for me.

667
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:08,800
I thought you served me a bowl.

668
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:10,240
I'll go get my own.

669
00:22:10,320 --> 00:22:10,880
I'll get a bowl.

670
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:16,720
Teng, this eggplant...

671
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:17,890
This eggplant...

672
00:22:17,890 --> 00:22:19,660
(Stuffed to the brim)

673
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:23,840
Anyu, aren't you mixing in
the eggplant sauce?

674
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:24,800
I am.

675
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:26,260
I'm making one giant mix.

676
00:22:27,900 --> 00:22:28,700
(One more huge scoop)
Double it!

677
00:22:31,700 --> 00:22:33,420
(A feast fit for a general)

678
00:22:34,780 --> 00:22:36,380
(Dig in)

679
00:22:44,860 --> 00:22:45,900
(So good)

680
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:49,240
Don't just eat that.

681
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:49,720
Have some noodles.

682
00:22:50,600 --> 00:22:51,520
We made them ourselves.

683
00:22:51,520 --> 00:22:52,720
Yeah, have some.

684
00:22:53,620 --> 00:22:54,500
(Here you go)

685
00:22:54,500 --> 00:22:55,500
(Your turn)

686
00:22:56,360 --> 00:22:57,640
One green bean each.

687
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:58,250
Sure.

688
00:23:00,380 --> 00:23:02,540
(Let me try some as well)

689
00:23:02,800 --> 00:23:03,480
Not bad.

690
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:04,130
Definitely good.

691
00:23:04,800 --> 00:23:05,720
Bai.

692
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:06,400
Here.

693
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:07,200
Try a green bean.

694
00:23:07,280 --> 00:23:07,840
Who?

695
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:08,280
Who?

696
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:09,260
(Asking for a friend)

697
00:23:09,300 --> 00:23:10,360
(Come on, bro)

698
00:23:10,360 --> 00:23:11,320
Be honest.

699
00:23:11,320 --> 00:23:11,960
Try it.

700
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:13,600
If it's bad, just say so.

701
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:15,640
I actually think it's pretty good.

702
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,240
Right?

703
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:17,160
(Finally, someone gets it)
It's your kind of flavor.

704
00:23:17,160 --> 00:23:18,160
I knew you'd like it.

705
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,040
We're both from Shandong.

706
00:23:19,040 --> 00:23:20,720
I swear. Seriously.

707
00:23:20,720 --> 00:23:21,440
It's pretty good.

708
00:23:21,520 --> 00:23:23,080
Quick, put it back.

709
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:24,840
You're blocking everyone.

710
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:26,060
It's fine. I can reach.

711
00:23:26,060 --> 00:23:27,460
(So considerate)

712
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:28,800
It's better than mine.

713
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:31,770
I'm gonna cry.

714
00:23:36,500 --> 00:23:37,580
(We did it, bro)

715
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:39,120
It's really better than mine.

716
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:40,720
It's actually pretty good.

717
00:23:40,720 --> 00:23:42,150
The viewers may not...

718
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:44,120
get to taste it,

719
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:47,970
but they can read those expressions.

720
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:54,600
Costume change.

721
00:23:56,600 --> 00:23:57,840
Bai lost some thigh weight

722
00:23:57,840 --> 00:23:58,850
this episode.

723
00:23:58,850 --> 00:24:00,380
(The upside of dressing out of season)

724
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:02,460
Where's that hat of yours?

725
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:06,100
He'd pass out right here.

726
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:08,520
That hat with those leather pants?

727
00:24:08,520 --> 00:24:10,150
Are you trying to kill Bai?

728
00:24:11,320 --> 00:24:12,170
A fur belt.

729
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:14,720
It's a fashion statement.

730
00:24:15,280 --> 00:24:16,410
He's sacrificed enough already.

731
00:24:19,700 --> 00:24:22,020
(Search for some post-meal music)

732
00:24:33,160 --> 00:24:34,110
Turn that off.

733
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,840
Honestly,
I skipped everyone else's parts.

734
00:24:36,840 --> 00:24:37,860
I only listened to yours.

735
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:40,020
This is how I serve food now.

736
00:24:44,120 --> 00:24:46,070
We should sing this
for the season finale.

737
00:24:51,040 --> 00:24:52,560
Are we gonna get food

738
00:24:52,560 --> 00:24:53,560
this good every day?

739
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:56,120
What if I go home, gain weight,
and can't get any acting roles?

740
00:24:57,560 --> 00:24:58,900
Always thinking about acting.

741
00:24:58,900 --> 00:25:01,420
(Food coma)

742
00:25:01,460 --> 00:25:05,020
(Except...)

743
00:25:06,360 --> 00:25:07,080
Eat up, bro.

744
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,720
What's scary is you never stop.

745
00:25:12,800 --> 00:25:14,210
You don't eat in intervals.

746
00:25:14,470 --> 00:25:15,990
You just keep swallowing.

747
00:25:16,100 --> 00:25:24,380
(Showing off his stomach capacity)

748
00:25:24,840 --> 00:25:25,660
This is my last bowl.

749
00:25:27,080 --> 00:25:28,560
They said there's nothing
for indigestion on the island.

750
00:25:30,780 --> 00:25:31,480
Try it.

751
00:25:31,480 --> 00:25:32,930
Try Churan's.

752
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:41,760
Great hype.

753
00:25:41,760 --> 00:25:43,000
This corn...

754
00:25:43,080 --> 00:25:43,800
This corn...

755
00:25:43,800 --> 00:25:44,780
(Now that's some corn)

756
00:25:50,540 --> 00:25:51,660
(My soup!)

757
00:25:51,900 --> 00:25:52,940
(Half of it spilled!)

758
00:25:55,500 --> 00:25:56,740
(I'm so sorry)

759
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:57,490
Mr. Huang...

760
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,600
That's a direct challenge.

761
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:01,370
You really don't want me
to have any, huh?

762
00:26:02,660 --> 00:26:03,310
Afraid I'll gain weight?

763
00:26:05,620 --> 00:26:06,470
I'll try the soup.

764
00:26:06,870 --> 00:26:07,640
Just take a little first.

765
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:09,060
Just a little, huh?

766
00:26:09,760 --> 00:26:11,280
Save some for the others
in case it's good, right?

767
00:26:11,280 --> 00:26:12,150
No.

768
00:26:13,360 --> 00:26:15,840
If it's bad,
you'll have an easy way out.

769
00:26:15,920 --> 00:26:17,240
It's your first episode.

770
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:19,560
Even if there were sand in it,

771
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:20,900
(I'd drink anything, bro)
I'd still finish it.

772
00:26:20,940 --> 00:26:22,460
(No need to go that far, bro)

773
00:26:28,780 --> 00:26:30,420
(Waiting for the verdict)

774
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:34,810
It could've used some sand.

775
00:26:37,760 --> 00:26:38,360
Is it a little salty?

776
00:26:38,360 --> 00:26:39,360
It's actually really good.

777
00:26:39,440 --> 00:26:40,820
No, it's not salty at all.

778
00:26:40,820 --> 00:26:42,700
(Delicious)

779
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:43,740
Seriously?

780
00:26:44,740 --> 00:26:46,580
(Mmm, good)

781
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:49,040
Gotta give credit where it's due.

782
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:52,130
Churan's soup ranks second.

783
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:56,680
Really.

784
00:26:57,280 --> 00:26:58,250
Where's the soup?

785
00:26:58,680 --> 00:26:59,170
Right here.

786
00:27:00,640 --> 00:27:01,800
Wring out that cloth,

787
00:27:01,800 --> 00:27:03,310
