788
00:27:03,460 --> 00:27:05,780
(I helped make it too)

789
00:27:09,360 --> 00:27:10,160
The soup's really flavorful.

790
00:27:12,700 --> 00:27:14,340
(Pretty good)

791
00:27:14,440 --> 00:27:15,960
The corn adds a lot of flavor.

792
00:27:15,960 --> 00:27:16,500
So good.

793
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:19,080
We picked some dishes

794
00:27:19,270 --> 00:27:20,560
that got a lot of love online

795
00:27:20,560 --> 00:27:22,120
and had people talking.

796
00:27:22,120 --> 00:27:23,180
(Hit recipes)
Hit recipes.

797
00:27:23,680 --> 00:27:26,160
Don't tell me your
candied chicken wings made the list.

798
00:27:26,240 --> 00:27:29,500
I told you,
that dish is top three, easy.

799
00:27:29,500 --> 00:27:30,100
(100% confident)

