Candied chicken wings.

830
00:28:17,660 --> 00:28:18,740
(Speak of the devil)

831
00:28:20,320 --> 00:28:21,160
Now we're talking.

832
00:28:21,160 --> 00:28:23,080
That sauce really cooked down.

833
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:24,160
