867
00:29:21,520 --> 00:29:22,320
Love it.

868
00:29:22,400 --> 00:29:22,880
Love it.

869
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:24,900
Pass him the eggplant.

870
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:27,950
It's just bland dumpling filling.

871
00:29:28,440 --> 00:29:30,430
Wait, is this a ranking
of the tastiest dishes?

872
00:29:31,920 --> 00:29:32,530
What are you talking about?

873
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:33,710
It's based on

874
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,400
how much buzz they got.

875
00:29:35,740 --> 00:29:37,180
(Home-style tofu)

876
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:38,880
Home-style tofu, made by Bai.

877
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,060
(Home-style tofu)

878
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,640
