How you use the paste really matters.

880
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:45,320
Look at Bai explaining it now.

881
00:29:45,320 --> 00:29:47,400
He knows the saltiness
doesn't come from salt.

882
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,480
It comes from the bean paste.

883
00:29:48,480 --> 00:29:49,600
You're a real pro now.

884
00:29:49,860 --> 00:29:51,020
(Looking smug)

885
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,200
See that?

886
00:29:52,280 --> 00:29:53,240
That's expertise.

887
00:29:53,320 --> 00:29:53,720
Not bad.

888
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,280
Now that's something.

889
00:29:54,280 --> 00:29:55,280
Even Bing approves.

890
00:29:55,280 --> 00:29:56,680
Ready to serve! Home-style tofu.

891
00:29:56,680 --> 00:29:57,580
Home-style tofu.

892
00:29:58,240 --> 00:29:59,540
Yours is better than the restaurant's.

893
00:30:00,500 --> 00:30:01,260
(Home-style tofu)

894
00:30:09,040 --> 00:30:09,590
Who?

895
00:30:10,320 --> 00:30:11,370
Hot and sour shredded potatoes. Yours.

896
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,220
My dish?

897
00:30:15,000 --> 00:30:16,720
Hot and sour shredded potatoes,
made by Shen Teng.

898
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:17,880
Can you toss it?

899
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:19,000
You're gonna toss the wok?

900
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,110
I just learned this move.

901
00:30:21,640 --> 00:30:22,340
Got it down?

902
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:24,640
Whoa, look at those flames.

903
00:30:25,060 --> 00:30:25,620
(Shen Teng's hot and sour potatoes)

904
00:30:25,620 --> 00:30:26,220
(1. Shred potatoes, soak and drain)

905
00:30:26,220 --> 00:30:26,820
(2. Heat oil and fry dried chilies)

906
00:30:26,820 --> 00:30:27,240
(3. Add potatoes and stir-fry)

907
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:27,900
(4. Add peppers, season and stir-fry)

908
00:30:27,900 --> 00:30:29,360
(Season 1, Season 2, Season 3)
That's the beauty of this show.

909
00:30:29,600 --> 00:30:31,220
You get to see how everyone's grown.

910
00:30:33,280 --> 00:30:34,450
Come on. Let's eat.

911
00:30:37,780 --> 00:30:38,250
That's it.

912
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:40,080
Delicious.

913
00:30:40,080 --> 00:30:41,020
Bing, sorry.

914
00:30:41,520 --> 00:30:42,830
I'm catching up to you.

915
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:45,970
Now this means something.

916
00:30:46,340 --> 00:30:47,540
