917
00:30:51,280 --> 00:30:53,160
Teng approves of the list now.

918
00:30:53,240 --> 00:30:54,520
Very credible.

919
00:30:54,600 --> 00:30:56,480
That's it for today.

920
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:58,000
Get some good rest.

921
00:30:58,000 --> 00:31:00,100
We'll hit the road again tomorrow.

922
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:01,120
Okay.

923
00:31:01,210 --> 00:31:01,620
Okay.

924
00:31:04,220 --> 00:31:06,900
(Together we set out
across mountains and seas)

925
00:31:50,520 --> 00:31:51,080
Let's go.

926
00:31:51,080 --> 00:31:52,640
(Next episode)
Into the water!

927
00:31:52,640 --> 00:31:55,080
First time starting the show
in something this tight.

928
00:31:55,080 --> 00:31:55,560
Yeah.

929
00:31:55,560 --> 00:31:56,680
Starting off in a wetsuit.

930
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:58,240
Only VIPs get to see the back.

931
00:31:58,240 --> 00:32:01,040
How many points to unlock the back view?

932
00:32:01,040 --> 00:32:03,400
You can even carve your own words here.

933
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:05,800
(VIP exclusive)
How many points to see the back?

934
00:32:05,800 --> 00:32:06,320
Let's go!

935
