Oh no, it's spilling!

939
00:32:26,800 --> 00:32:28,760
Report! Hurry!

940
00:32:28,760 --> 00:32:30,080
Quick, Bai!

941
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:31,800
Bai, hurry!

942
00:32:31,880 --> 00:32:32,520
Report!

943
00:32:32,720 --> 00:32:34,120
Report!

944
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:35,960
I'm the only witness.

945
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,470
Anyu is out this round.

946
00:32:38,760 --> 00:32:40,640
Mr. Huang was all over the place.

947
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:41,700
He came out of this room.

948
00:32:42,080 --> 00:32:43,370
By the time they called it,
he was already here.

949
00:32:43,800 --> 00:32:44,160
I...

950
00:32:44,160 --> 00:32:45,920
I just got caught up in the moment!

951
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:46,960
Everyone was calling it!

952
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:48,640
I just got here first!

953
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:49,360
Everyone was calling it!

954
00:32:49,360 --> 00:32:50,400
No.

955
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:51,800
He said everyone wanted him out.

956
00:32:51,800 --> 00:32:52,160
Right?

957
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:52,980
(We've got the receipts)
Only Huang Jingyu was yelling.

958
00:32:52,980 --> 00:32:53,720
(The Brain Trust rolls out)
Did you yell or not?

959
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:55,180
I said we could report it.

960
00:32:55,680 --> 00:32:57,080
I said we really could.

961
00:32:57,080 --> 00:32:58,170
Did Fan Chengcheng yell?

962
00:32:58,800 --> 00:33:00,480
I only said I was thinking about it.

963
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:01,920
You're the one who did it.

964
00:33:01,920 --> 00:33:03,560
You were egging him on.

965
00:33:03,560 --> 00:33:03,980
I yelled it as well.

966
00:33:06,080 --> 00:33:07,040
I yelled it as well.

967
00:33:07,040 --> 00:33:08,760
He doesn't care about losing.

968
00:33:08,760 --> 00:33:09,280
What he really cares about

969
00:33:09,280 --> 00:33:11,030
