970
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:13,800
(No cop? Security it is)
I've been on security duty.

971
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:15,760
(Protection)
You get worked up every round,

972
00:33:15,840 --> 00:33:18,080
and every person
you guard gets eliminated.

973
00:33:18,080 --> 00:33:19,160
Is that really protection,

974
00:33:19,160 --> 00:33:20,840
or are you making things worse?

975
00:33:21,080 --> 00:33:22,180
I'm done protecting people.

976
00:33:22,180 --> 00:33:23,980
(Security guard off duty)

977
00:33:24,360 --> 00:33:26,200
Our team's way too good at this game.

978
00:33:26,240 --> 00:33:27,360
We've got an artist

979
00:33:27,360 --> 00:33:29,320
and a master of words.

980
00:33:29,360 --> 00:33:30,370
How many characters?

981
00:33:30,500 --> 00:33:31,080
(4 characters)

982
00:33:31,080 --> 00:33:31,480
Four.

983
00:33:31,480 --> 00:33:32,840
It's so nice having Churan here.

984
00:33:34,380 --> 00:33:35,020
(That makes 5)

985
00:33:35,020 --> 00:33:35,840
Five characters.

986
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:37,900
Four or five, I guess.

987
00:33:37,900 --> 00:33:38,140
(This body part)

988
00:33:38,140 --> 00:33:39,040
(Intestines)

989
00:33:39,040 --> 00:33:40,240
Braised pork intestines.

990
00:33:40,240 --> 00:33:41,920
There's still some left.

991
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:43,120
Nice aftertaste.

992
00:33:43,120 --> 00:33:44,200
Smells amazing.

993
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:45,640
Braised intestines riding in a car.

994
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:46,980
Keeps the original flavor.

995
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:49,120
You're pointing at it with a pen!

996
00:33:49,120 --> 00:33:50,720
If I could understand it,
why would I need you to point?

997
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:52,350
Get him!

998
00:33:57,760 --> 00:33:59,480
Catch me, Wang Anyu.

999
00:33:59,560 --> 00:34:00,600
(Protection)
My hand's right here.

1000
00:34:05,680 --> 00:34:06,870
What's wrong with you, Bing?

1001
00:34:11,760 --> 00:34:12,990
Let's go!

1002
00:34:17,720 --> 00:34:18,990
I'm flying!

1003
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,610
I'm flying!

1004
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:24,000
One wave washes everything away.

1005
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:25,480
We get to see old friends again.

1006
00:34:26,200 --> 00:34:27,170
Now I'm feeling it.

1007
00:34:27,560 --> 00:34:29,800
This time, we'll follow the water,

1008
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:31,730
explore all its different forms,

1009
00:34:31,740 --> 00:34:33,840
and discover the many ways
life thrives within it.

1010
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:37,660
Let's set off now!

